            "display_title": "This paper presents an analysis on the large-width functional asymptotics of the fully connected feed-forward deep neural networks where weights and biases are independent and identically distributed according to Gaussian distributions and proves that such a network defines a continuous Gaussian process  with certain limiting properties.  However, I doubt  these results can be used to improve the learning performance  of the network for either general or specific task.",
